{"sections":[{"slug":"分类空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"分类空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"分类空间"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一种结构</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span></strong> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是这样一个空间</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">任何空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的结构</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span>.\n$$\r\n\\{X\\,\\text{上的}\\,P\\,\\text{结构}\\} \\simeq \\{X\\to B\\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是结构</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">的全体对应的函子的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表示对象</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">因而</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">到自身的恒等映射对应着</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">万有</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的这种结构</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">初等几何中的模空间</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>$S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的两个无序的点的模空间是圆环面在对称群的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">下的商</span> $T^2/S_2$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">纤维范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对应于函子</span> $X^{\\text{op}}\\to \\mathsf{Cat}$, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck构造","text":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">构造</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">这可以理解为</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是范畴的分类空间</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若要求每个纤维均等价于某个固定的纤维</span> $F$, <span lang=\"zh\">则这样一个函子</span> $X^{\\text{op}}\\to \\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的像落在</span> $\\mathbf{B}{\\operatorname{Aut}(F)}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">指的是其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$, <span lang=\"zh\">它是一个带基点连通空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">带有万有</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" ${*}\\to \\mathbf{B}G$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类意象</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/分类叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类叠</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}